# 36_shamanic_drum_RGB.ledc — Shamanic Journey Drum, RGB inner/outer build (base: 36_shamanic_trance_drum; name shortened for SPIFFS 32-char limit)
# RGB variant of 36_shamanic_trance_drum. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (monaural drum carriers
# ch1/2 + trapezoid iso drum-hit ch3 w/ jitter + rotating brown bed ch4). The 8->4.5->9 Hz
# drum-flash maps to the concentric rings: inner ring warm amber (mask 9, 255,160,32, phase
# 0) + outer ring deep amber (mask 6, 255,80,0, phase 180), TRAPEZOID gate (env 3, 6 ms edge)
# — a sharp warm radial pulse in step with the drum, antiphase so the field breathes
# inner<->outer. Non-saturated warm (safe to flicker); rates <=10 Hz; brightness <=30%.
# See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase attack]

# --- Onset: amber 8 Hz trapezoid flash + monaural drum + iso hit + brown bed, fade in ---
0 8 50 >0 255 160 32 9 3 0 6                  # inner amber: 8 Hz trapezoid (6 ms edge); bright fade-in
0 8 50 >0 255 80 0 6 3 180 6                  # outer deep-amber: antiphase
A 0 90 ~-100:100:8000 >0 4.5 4 0 6 50 1       # ch4 BROWN bed: 4.5 Hz sine-gated, rotating pan (8 s); vol fade-in
A 60000 90 ~-100:100:8000 25 4.5 4 0 6 50 1   # ch4 brown settled
A 0 160 0 >0 0 1 0 0                          # ch1 monaural carrier A (160 Hz, pan 0); vol fade-in
A 0 168 0 >0 0 2 0 0                          # ch2 monaural carrier B (168 Hz) => 8 Hz drum in the air
A 0 137 0 >0 8 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000       # ch3 iso drum hit: 137 Hz, 8 Hz trapezoid gate, 35% duty; jitter 0.3 Hz/53 s
S 5000 default 52 "Lie down and let the drum find its rhythm around you. Let it carry you toward the journey."
20000 8 50 26 255 160 32 9 3 0 6              # inner: 26% reached (>=15 s ramp-in)
20000 8 50 26 255 80 0 6 3 180 6             # outer
A 45000 160 0 50 0 1 0 0                      # ch1 settled
A 45000 168 0 50 0 2 0 0                      # ch2 settled (drum steady 8 Hz)
A 45000 137 0 40 8 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000   # ch3 iso drum settled
45000 8 50 ~14:30:12000 255 160 32 9 3 0 6    # inner: breathing brightness LFO engages (0.1 Hz)
45000 8 50 ~14:30:12000 255 80 0 6 3 180 6    # outer

# --- Descent into the journey (drum 8->4.5) ---
A 180000 160 0 50 0 1 0 0                      # ch1 carrier A held (anchor tone)
A 180000 >168 0 50 0 2 0 0                     # ch2 168->164.5 => monaural beat 8->4.5
A 180000 137 0 40 >8 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000  # ch3 iso pulse 8->4.5 (mod interpolatable); jitter on
180000 >8 50 ~14:30:12000 255 160 32 9 3 0 6   # inner: flash tracks drum 8->4.5, breathing continues
180000 >8 50 ~14:30:12000 255 80 0 6 3 180 6   # outer
S 180000 default 52 "Let the drum slow and carry you downward, into the between-place."

# --- Journey hold (4.5 Hz) ---
A 480000 164.5 0 55 0 2 0 0                    # ch2 at 164.5 => 4.5 Hz monaural drum, fuller vol
A 480000 137 0 45 4.5 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000 # ch3 iso drum at 4.5 Hz, jitter drifting
480000 4.5 50 ~14:30:12000 255 160 32 9 3 0 6  # inner: 4.5 Hz trapezoid flash, gentle breathing
480000 4.5 50 ~14:30:12000 255 80 0 6 3 180 6  # outer
S 480000 default 52 "You are in the journey now. Let the steady drum hold you. Travel, and let it be your thread home."
S 1080000 default 52 "Wander freely. The drum will not let you lose your way; it beats on beneath everything."

# --- Recall (drum 4.5->9, the quickening) ---
A 1440000 >164.5 0 55 0 2 0 0                  # ch2 164.5->169 => monaural beat 4.5->9
A 1440000 137 0 45 >4.5 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000 # ch3 iso pulse 4.5->9 lockstep
1440000 >4.5 50 26 255 160 32 9 3 0 6          # inner: 4.5->9, steady 26% (LFO dropped for alerting)
1440000 >4.5 50 26 255 80 0 6 3 180 6          # outer
S 1440000 default 52 "The drum is calling you back. Begin to return, following the quickening beat homeward."

# --- Wake fade (9->10) ---
A 1620000 160 0 >50 0 1 0 0                    # ch1 carrier A vol fade
A 1620000 >169 0 >55 0 2 0 0                   # ch2 169->170 (beat 9->10) and vol fade
A 1620000 137 0 >45 >9 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000 # ch3 iso pulse 9->10, vol fade
A 1620000 90 ~-100:100:8000 >25 4.5 4 0 6 50 1  # brown bed fade
1620000 >9 50 >26 255 160 32 9 3 0 6           # inner: 9->10, brightness fade
1620000 >9 50 >26 255 80 0 6 3 180 6           # outer
S 1620000 default 52 "Come fully back to the room now. Feel the ground beneath you, and open your eyes when you are ready."
A 1800000 160 0 0 0 1 0 0                       # ch1 vol 0
A 1800000 170 0 0 0 2 0 0                       # ch2 vol 0 (beat settled 10)
A 1800000 137 0 0 10 3 0 0 35 3 0 8 0.3:53000   # ch3 vol 0
A 1800000 90 ~-100:100:8000 0 4.5 4 0 6 50 1    # brown bed 0
1800000 10 50 0 255 160 32 9 3 0 6             # inner off
1800000 10 50 0 255 80 0 6 3 180 6             # outer off
